{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11522","headline":"十二月一日三首 二 · 杜甫","name":"十二月一日三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒轻市上山烟碧，日满楼前江雾黄。\n负盐出井此谿女，打鼓发船何郡郎。\n新亭举目风景切，茂陵着书消渴长。\n春花不愁不烂漫，楚客唯听棹相将。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_11522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_11522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}